      "max_exclusive": null,
      "kind": "raw",
      "type": "SetMargin_t",
      "notes": "Paired IDA audits on 28000.1, 28000.2525, and 28000.2704 show UpdateMargins consumes only AL after its two direct calls, but UpdateMarginsDependentOnStyle privately reuses RCX after the three-argument wrapper returns: cmovz selects the preserved destination pointer as the later SetClipMargins argument. Use the RCX-preserving physical dispatcher and keep replacement dispatch, the original call, and HookRundown release inside the preserved region."
    },
